WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.947
Singapore OHCA snapshot.

00:00:01.947 --> 00:00:08.273
The 2019 registry recorded 3,233 out-of-hospital cardiac arrests in Singapore.

00:00:08.273 --> 00:00:23.684
About 74% occurred at home; bystander CPR occurred in 60%, bystander defibrillation in 10.5%, overall survival was 6.2%, and 4.8% were discharged with good-to-moderate neurological function.
